  "description": "Pasta with a light and creamy sauce, tender chunks of tuna, and peas is ready in about 15 minutes start to finish. All it takes is a single large skillet or pot, one burner or hot plate, a bowl, and a fork.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Extra-virgin olive oil, for drizzling (optional); Crushed potato chips, for topping (optional)\n\nNotes: To make a more traditional casserole, transfer hot tuna noodle mixture to a baking dish. Top with crushed potato chips or bread crumbs and broil about 20 cm from the broiler element until crisp and browned on top.",
